# sermod's settings. The database URLs and the server's key are Secrets,
# each named in deployment.yaml; none of them is here. docs/configuration.md
# describes every variable.
#
# The Ingress serves sermod under /v1/messaging, the prefix sermod writes in
# front of every route of its own, so it does not rewrite.
#
# Fill in: the file of the server's key is where deployment.yaml mounts the
# Secret sermod-service-key; keep the path if you keep the mount. Every
# group names this key, so it is kept for as long as the database is.
SERMO_SERVICE_KEY_FILE=/var/run/sermod-service-key/seed
